  "bodyHash": "e1d43eedc3392fa2",
  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/pixelshot/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/pixelshot/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flunapixel.studio%252fdiscord\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Discord&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252fFusseel\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Twitter&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=x&logoColor=white\" width=\"116\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@heyitsfuzs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=YouTube&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=youtube&logoColor=white\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=GitHub&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=github&logoColor=white\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=CurseForge&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=white\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fFuzs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Modrinth&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&logoColor=white\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/pixelshot/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Pixelshot</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 为 Minecraft 带来了强大的相机工具，让你能够以惊艳的新方式轻松记录你的世界。它内置了可调节的正交相机，可提供流畅的等轴测视图；支持高分辨率截图模式，可生成最高达 16K 的超清画质；还提供全景拍摄功能，方便你制作完整的 360&deg; 主菜单背景。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">借助内置的正交相机，你可以将视角拉远，从全新的角度俯瞰世界。非常适合用于建筑展示、地图制作和电影级镜头拍摄。只需通过简单的菜单或快捷按键即可轻松调整缩放、旋转和视角设置，实现流畅控制。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">无论你是想炫耀庞大的建筑作品、截取完美的壁纸，还是设计专属的主菜单背景，这款模组都能让你的每一帧画面都惊艳无比。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/pixelshot/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/features.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🧭 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">正交相机：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">以干净的等轴测视图记录你的世界。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🔍 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">可调缩放与角度：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">通过菜单或快捷按键微调你的视角。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">📸 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">高分辨率截图：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">拍摄最高达 16K 的超清图像，展现惊人细节。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🌅 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">全景拍摄：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">捕捉完整的 360&deg; 画面，用作自定义主菜单背景。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⌨️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">便捷操控：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">使用预设快捷键即时切换视角或缩放等级，操作丝滑。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🧩 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">完美搭配：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">可与 hashalite 开发的 Freecam 模组无缝配合，实现自由移动相机。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⚙️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">兼容 Sodium：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">建议禁用 <em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Use Block Face Culling</span></em> 以获得最佳视觉效果。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/pixelshot/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/media.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/pixelshot/media/1.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/pixelshot/media/2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/pixelshot/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/installation.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需要安装在客户端</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需要安装 </span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/puzzles-lib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">PUZZLES LIB</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> (FABRIC & NEOFORGE)</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需要安装 </span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">FABRIC API</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> (FABRIC)</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需要安装 </span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forge-config-api-port-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">FORGE CONFIG API PORT</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> (FABRIC)</span></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/pixelshot/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/configuration.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">如果模组支持配置，可直接在游戏内通过模组菜单进行修改（Fabric 端需要安装由 Prospector 开发的 Mod Menu）。请注意，在较旧的 Minecraft 版本中，还需要安装 Forge Config Screens。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">若需使用外部文本编辑器进行手动配置，所有文件均位于 </span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">.minecraft/config</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 目录下，文件名分别为 </span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MOD_ID-client.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">、</span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MOD_ID-common.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 或 </span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MOD_ID-server.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">，具体取决于配置文件类型。并非所有模组都会包含全部类型的配置文件，具体视模组而定。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/pixelshot/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/credits.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">特别感谢 </span><a href=\"https://www.minecraftforum.net/members/BarracudaATA\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">BarracudaATA</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 创作的惊艳模组 Mineshot，它在我多年前首次激发了我制作 Minecraft 模组的灵感。尽管本项目已完全重构，但 Mineshot 始终是其核心灵感来源。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">衷心感谢 </span><a href=\"https://github.com/pascallj\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">pascallj</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 通过 Mineshot Revived 让 Mineshot 焕发新生，其传承了原版精神并启发我创作了完全现代化的全新版本。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/pixelshot/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<table style=\"text-align:center\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/diagonal-windows\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/diagonalwindows/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spiky-spikes\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/spikyspikes/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/health-bars\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/healthbars/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/horse-expert\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/horseexpert/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enchanting-infuser\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enchantinginfuser/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/convenient-effects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/convenienteffects/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/new-paper-doll\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/paperdoll/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/hang-glider\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/hangglider/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dyed-flames\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/dyedflames/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/universal-enchants\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/universalenchants/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/pixelshot/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flunapixel.studio%252fdiscord\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/studio.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/pixelshot/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>",
